<div class="container prose">
  <p>Unexplained high water bills, warm spots on the floor, water dripping from ceiling, or the sound of running water when everything is off can signal leaks under slab, behind walls, in the attic, or in the yard. Houston's expansive clay soils and roots push on foundations and stress piping, so we see pinhole leaks and fitting failures weekly.</p>
  <h2>Our process</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Pressure testing to narrow the search zone</li>
    <li>Targeted access to minimize drywall or tile removal</li>
    <li>Repair or section replacement using quality materials</li>
    <li>Guidance on whether spot repair or repiping is the smarter long-term fix</li>
    <li>Full water service line replacement from the meter to the house</li>
  </ul>
  <p>Fast action limits mold risk and foundation issues. If you suspect a leak, call {{ site.phoneDisplay }}.</p>
